Comment:
 The package is self-contained: /opt/spacemissionstudio/python is a
 private CPython with Basilisk, SpaceMissionStudio, the packages they use
 and the reference data runs read (packaging/bundle_python.py). Each
 Python package keeps its own licence files in its .dist-info folder under
 /opt/spacemissionstudio/python/lib/python3.14/site-packages; the stanzas
 below say which licence applies to which part (a later stanza is more
 specific and wins).

