License: PSF-2.0
 CPython 3.14, as built by python-build-standalone
 (https://github.com/astral-sh/python-build-standalone). The full text, with
 the licences of earlier versions, is in
 /opt/spacemissionstudio/python/lib/python3.14/LICENSE.txt.
 python-build-standalone builds CPython with libraries of its own (OpenSSL,
 SQLite, libffi, XZ, zlib and others), each under its own licence as that
 project documents them ("Licensing" in its docs/running.rst); it links
 libedit, not readline, so no GPL library is linked.

